  "title": "Notes as related information",
  "summary": "The notes clang attaches to an error point to the places they name",
  "prose": "An error comes with the notes that explain it, such as where a name was first defined or which candidate a call could not use. Each note is related information of the error, so an editor shows it beside the error and jumps to its place.",
